      "sourceTextSha256": "8ac31f9d3648b869edfe36a71e3ac8b2c589775ddc2eb23d8e8f02c9acebf481",
      "text": "Papallacta, at about 3,300 m, lies where the high Andes descend towards the Amazon. Its thermal baths, beside the Papallacta River, include nine hot pools and three cold ones; the springs range from 30 to 70 °C, while the pools stay between 36 and 40 °C and are rich in sulphates, sodium, calcium and magnesium. After a morning in the waters, continue to Hacienda San Agustín de Callo, a beautifully restored historic hacienda near Cotopaxi. (B, D)",
